7. General Comments on data

Due to an error in the surface pressure reading between Oct. 16, 2016 and 
April 15, 2017, surface pressure values were obtained from the NOAA/ESRL/GML
group also operating at WLEF (jonathan.kofler@noaa.gov and 
philip.handley@noaa.gov) and were substituted for the erroneous values.

